<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others had invited me, but I had turned them down, and I was lying face down on the bed in my room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How much time had passed with me lying like this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Today was a half day with only the entrance ceremony, so I had summoned all my strength to avoid ending up in the nurse's room―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I had walked home from school on unsteady legs and finally made it back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Had an hour gone by since I collapsed onto the bed, no, three hours?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was almost time for the orange evening sun to dye the room.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others, what are they doing now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> must be enjoying food-stall menu items like yakisoba and fried chicken.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm grateful they invited me to the festival, but for me, the Cherry Blossom Festival is suicide.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that I want to deny how everyone loves the cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">April has only just begun, and plenty of people must be excited about their new lives.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, maybe a lot of people get depressed at this time of year as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Plenty of people must be stressed by the change in their surroundings.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But in my case, it's different.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The cherry blossoms―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When the season comes and the cherry blossoms bloom, I―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Through the open window, along with a light breeze, came the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="けんそう">bustle</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> of the outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now and then a child's voice, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of a car, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of the wind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The intercom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Getting up was </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="おっくう">a chore</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought about pretending nobody was home, but...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Okay, okay, I'm opening it now.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I opened the door, a high-school girl with short hair was standing there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought, it was </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey! How's it going?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... so-so."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To her cheerful greeting, the same as always, I answered with something like a polite smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The corners of my mouth wouldn't lift properly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm... So your April sickness still isn't any better this year."</STYLE> [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, it happens every year, so I'm used to it by now."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Over on our end, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> went around stuffing her face at one food stall after another, and it was rough. Going 'Operation start!' again and all that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">What does she think my wallet is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even as she said that, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> sounded happy telling me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> may be tiny, but she's a big eater. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Where does all that food go?"</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "53" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"My stomach's been off since yesterday too, so I only snacked a little, though. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So, here. Souvenir!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I was handed a plastic bag, neither big nor small.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"It's takoyaki, so eat it while it's hot. See you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\靴足音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Soon after our door closed, the sound of the door next to ours opening and closing echoed faintly along the outside walkway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> had left in a hurry, but she was probably worried about the strain on my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Making </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> worry about me like this has become my routine every year at this time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Heaving another big sigh, I took the plastic bag and went back to my room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\自室背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\small_window_C.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "SE2" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">It had gotten chilly, so I closed the window.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I put the takoyaki on the desk and crawled into bed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sure enough, my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> knows me well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She came by like this last year, and the year before that, too, didn't she?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm always the one being looked after, and I've hardly done anything to thank her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The day before yesterday </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to have an upset stomach, but the next time </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> isn't feeling well, I'll bring a gift along and go visit her.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> calls this gloomy mood of mine </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しがつびょう">April sickness</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In cherry blossom season, I sink into a funk, like someone with the May blues.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't really understand it, but it seems my constitution can't tolerate cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For me, early April is nothing but pain.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Seeing </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s face, I felt a little better, I think.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And, maybe because the tension had eased, a pleasant drowsiness stroked my eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I should sleep now, even a little, while I can. My mind and body must both be tired.</STYLE><PG>
