<STYLE ID="1">When I opened my eyes, the room had already gone pitch dark.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"It's dinnertime already. Come on, quick."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Coming."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I sat up in the pitch-dark room.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe thanks to the rest, my body seemed to be in good shape.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I was awfully sleepy...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I had dreamed something; my sleep had felt shallow.</STYLE><PG>
