{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, shoot..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">The takoyaki she had given me had gone completely cold.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Since I had it anyway, I would add it to dinner as one of the dishes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> both like takoyaki.</STYLE><PG>
