{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Morning. How are you feeling?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was cooking with her back to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mmm... better than this afternoon."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Think you can eat?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, I'll eat properly today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> isn't back yet?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"He says he's suddenly been sent on a business trip to Hokkaido. He'll be back next week, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s business trips are always so sudden."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is some kind of engineer for cell phone equipment, and ever since he got a small promotion, they've been sending him on business trips all over the place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For my part, it's a little lonely.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s not here, huh. And I was going to eat takoyaki with him."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Takoyaki?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> gave it to me. As a get-well present."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I handed the bag to </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"We're always, always imposing on </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">-chan. We'll have to thank her later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... really. I'll thank her properly later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> both like </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> very</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> much.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電子レンジ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> put the takoyaki in the microwave, and in the meantime moved the stir-fry from the frying pan onto plates.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I had no appetite, but takoyaki that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had given me, I could probably manage somehow.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Sorry to keep you waiting. Okay, let's eat."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rice and miso soup, and then dried horse mackerel and kinpira gobo.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To this plain dinner table, the takoyaki was added.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\たこ焼き桜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh..."</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Oh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the surface of the takoyaki sat </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="ひとひら">a single</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cherry blossom petal.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Sorry, I'll take it off right away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face had clouded over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But for me, not eating this is not an option.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just because I hate cherry blossoms, to refuse </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s get-well present, of all things.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I-I'm fine! Not eating it over something this small..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I lifted the takoyaki with my </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="はし">chopsticks</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
