<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPS>"Ngh... guhaah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>I rushed into the bathroom and crouched there, hunched over the toilet bowl.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPS>"Ngh... hurk..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Nothing came up from my empty stomach.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And yet I was </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="さいな">racked</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> by violent nausea and dizziness.</STYLE><PG>
