<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, are you okay!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPS>"Hack! Hack! I... I'm fine... This always happens... Go on and eat..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">All right. Call me if anything happens."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPS>"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
