{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Something like this is no big deal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It happens all the time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is the April sickness that comes over me every year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Strictly speaking, I suppose you might call it cherry-blossom phobia.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ever since I was old enough to remember, I've gotten sick like this at this time of year.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "19" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">So I'm used to it by now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm used to the symptoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But the cherry blossoms themselves are the one thing I can never get used to.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah... haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I steadied my breathing and calmed myself down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I'm a little better now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I thought the nap had made me feel better, but give it a trigger and this is what happens.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if it was something </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gave me, maybe I pushed myself a little too hard...</STYLE><PG>
