{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was sitting on the living room sofa, clutching her cell phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s cell phone was an old flip phone she had been using for about 10 years.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, I'm fine now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I see... If you're fine, then good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was oddly restless.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She was perched on the edge of the sofa, not pressing any of the phone's buttons, just scratching, scritch-scritch, at its surface with her nails.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's wrong? Did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh? No... nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Never mind that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you're the one who should at least eat some rice gruel. I'll make it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Okay, thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> put the phone in her pocket and headed for the kitchen.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">This time, I was the one who sat down on the sofa.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Through the window, still open, a slightly cold wind blew in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was just right for shaking off the dizziness, but a little cold.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\small_window_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">The cooking was done anyway, so I closed the window.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And at once, my heart began to settle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As if riding along on that, a drowsiness like the one this afternoon tried once again to sit down on my eyelids.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What was it? I was awfully sleepy today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even after that long nap earlier.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I felt like I'd had some scary dream. I didn't really feel like I'd slept.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe after I eat the rice gruel, I'll go to bed early.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, but I have to take a bath.</STYLE><PG>
