{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"What are you talking about, as wobbly as you are? Sit still and behave."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But I feel like moving around a little would help. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I think April sickness is a matter of mood. I'll go do it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
